---
// The " · " between two short phrases ("Level 1 · 1 to 10 people"). On screen: the dot. Screen readers and the
// Markdown copy (scripts/markdown.mjs drops aria-hidden parts): a comma, so it reads as a pause and not "dot".
// Inside a flex box (.eyebrow, .chip, .status) wrap the whole phrase in one <span>, or each piece gets the gap.
---
<span class="sr-only">, </span><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
